Generate only:
format_success_rate(numerator: int, denominator: int) -> str

Contract:
- denominator must be a positive int and bool is invalid;
- numerator must be an int in [0, denominator] and bool is invalid;
- invalid values raise ValueError;
- output exact percentage with one decimal place plus %;
- deterministic round-half-even;
- 0/3 -> 0.0%;
- 1/8 -> 12.5%;
- 1/6 -> 16.7%;
- 1/80 -> 1.2%;
- 23/80 -> 28.8%;
- 3/3 -> 100.0%;
- standard library only;
- no filesystem/network/global state.
Return only the Python artifact, with no explanation.
